    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Nuremberg Code is Dead</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors describing large-scale unethical human experimentation in the USSR have been circulating for several months, but were recently given confirmation from a Soviet defector, who has exposed the horrible truth of Shadow Project. The Soviet Union has established installations across its territory with the intended purpose of developing humans and animals into machines of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143530/extras/f2b8b931a1aed69af88fa3844f4b3add.poster.avif?t=1754675023\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143530/extras/f2b8b931a1aed69af88fa3844f4b3add.webm?t=1754675023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143530/extras/f2b8b931a1aed69af88fa3844f4b3add.mp4?t=1754675023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blood Must Spill</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the year 1990, you are part of an American team that is tasked with taking down a series of Soviet military facilities suspected of housing Shadow Project laboratories. Your journey will take you across a range of biomes throughout the former Soviet Union, including dense and lush forests, desolate abandoned villages, and snow capped mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143530/extras/9ccfb37d17e66597c9d4d295fe028913.poster.avif?t=1754675023\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143530/extras/9ccfb37d17e66597c9d4d295fe028913.webm?t=1754675023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143530/extras/9ccfb37d17e66597c9d4d295fe028913.mp4?t=1754675023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employ an arsenal of historically accurate weaponry in a wide variety of combat scenarios.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your surroundings with an open level design and terrifying subterranean pathways.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience tense encounters with the grotesque creations of the Soviet Union\u2019s new weapons program, while managing a limited amount of supplies and ammunition.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a weapon attachment system to customize your loadout and gameplay experience.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your gameplay experience with a suite of customization options.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Nuremberg Code is Dead</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rumors describing large-scale unethical human experimentation in the USSR have been circulating for several months, but were recently given confirmation from a Soviet defector, who has exposed the horrible truth of Shadow Project. The Soviet Union has established installations across its territory with the intended purpose of developing humans and animals into machines of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143530/extras/f2b8b931a1aed69af88fa3844f4b3add.poster.avif?t=1754675023\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143530/extras/f2b8b931a1aed69af88fa3844f4b3add.webm?t=1754675023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143530/extras/f2b8b931a1aed69af88fa3844f4b3add.mp4?t=1754675023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blood Must Spill</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the year 1990, you are part of an American team that is tasked with taking down a series of Soviet military facilities suspected of housing Shadow Project laboratories. Your journey will take you across a range of biomes throughout the former Soviet Union, including dense and lush forests, desolate abandoned villages, and snow capped mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143530/extras/9ccfb37d17e66597c9d4d295fe028913.poster.avif?t=1754675023\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143530/extras/9ccfb37d17e66597c9d4d295fe028913.webm?t=1754675023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143530/extras/9ccfb37d17e66597c9d4d295fe028913.mp4?t=1754675023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employ an arsenal of historically accurate weaponry in a wide variety of combat scenarios.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your surroundings with an open level design and terrifying subterranean pathways.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience tense encounters with the grotesque creations of the Soviet Union\u2019s new weapons program, while managing a limited amount of supplies and ammunition.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a weapon attachment system to customize your loadout and gameplay experience.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your gameplay experience with a suite of customization options.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
